<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<!--
	Rail badges: a <side-rail> whose sections carry badges, beside a conversation of its own.
	
	Each section of the rail declares its badge like any other element carrying one (badge,
	badge-role, badge-label): the badge stands beside the section's title and on its strip icon. The
	rail writes what the sections count beyond what the user has seen of them to its badge-channel -
	a section counts as seen while it is expanded in the open rail, so a collapsed section counts
	also while the rail is open - and the rail button in the head of the conversation, a command
	toggling the open-channel of the rail, shows that number as its badge.
	
	- Events counts the events of the demo, in the role of the brand. "New event" in the panel
	creates one, the delete command of a row in the section removes one.
	- Venues counts the venues, in the role warning.
	- Trial shows the number entered in the panel, in the role error: 0 shows no badge, a number above
	99 shows "99+", and the sum on the rail button then shows "99+" as well.
	- Marked shows a dot while the checkbox is ticked, in the role success, named by its badge-label
	for a screen reader. A dot adds nothing to the sum.
	- Notes has no badge and contributes nothing.
	
	The conversation and the rail join a chat of their own, and the rail has a state of its own, so
	this page neither shares the rail of the Chat page nor feeds the badge of the dock.
-->
<view>
	<channels>
		<channel name="eventCount"/>
		<channel name="venueCount"/>
		<channel name="trialCount"/>
		<channel name="marked"/>
		<channel name="selectedEvent"/>
		<channel name="railOpen"/>
		<channel name="railBadge"/>
	</channels>

	<chat chat-id="rail-badges">
		<split-panel
			orientation="horizontal"
			resizable="true"
		>
			<panes>
				<pane
					size="100"
					unit="%"
				>
					<!--
						The controls above the conversation, so the conversation takes the width the rail leaves and
						the height below the controls: the stack fills because the conversation's panel does.
					-->
					<stack>
						<panel with-inset="true">
							<title>
								<en>Rail badges</en>
								<de>Badges der Leiste</de>
							</title>
							<commands>
								<generic-command
									image="css:bi bi-plus-lg"
									placement="TOOLBAR"
								>
									<label>
										<en>New event</en>
										<de>Neue Veranstaltung</de>
									</label>
									<!-- A transient object, copied in by the dialog: an abandoned dialog leaves nothing behind. -->
									<execute-script function="new(`demo.events:Event`, transient: true)">
										<with-result>
											<open-dialog
												bind-input-to="model"
												close-on-backdrop="false"
												dialog-view="tl-ai-demo/events/create-event.view.xml"
											>
												<bind
													channel="selection"
													to="selectedEvent"
												/>
											</open-dialog>
										</with-result>
									</execute-script>
								</generic-command>
							</commands>
							<stack gap="default">
								<text>
									<label>
										<en>The sections of the rail on the right count the events and the venues of the demo. Create an event with "New event" or delete one in the section "Events", and its badge follows. The rail button in the head of the conversation shows how much the sections count beyond what you have seen of them: a section counts as seen while it is expanded in the open rail, so a collapsed section counts as new also while the rail is open. Enter a number to try the rules of a badge: 0 shows no badge, a number above 99 shows "99+". The checkbox marks the section "Marked" with a dot, which adds nothing to the count of the button.</en>
										<de>Die Abschnitte der Leiste rechts zählen die Veranstaltungen und die Veranstaltungsorte der Demo. Legen Sie mit „Neue Veranstaltung“ eine Veranstaltung an oder löschen Sie eine im Abschnitt „Veranstaltungen“, und dessen Badge folgt. Die Leisten-Schaltfläche im Kopf der Unterhaltung zeigt, wie viel die Abschnitte über das hinaus zählen, was Sie von ihnen gesehen haben: Ein Abschnitt gilt als gesehen, solange er in der offenen Leiste aufgeklappt ist, ein zugeklappter Abschnitt zählt also auch bei offener Leiste als neu. Geben Sie eine Zahl ein, um die Regeln eines Badges auszuprobieren: 0 zeigt kein Badge, eine Zahl über 99 zeigt „99+“. Das Kontrollkästchen markiert den Abschnitt „Markiert“ mit einem Punkt, der nicht in die Zahl der Schaltfläche eingeht.</de>
									</label>
								</text>
								<value-input
									type="tl.core:Integer"
									value="trialCount"
								>
									<label>
										<en>Count of the section "Trial"</en>
										<de>Zahl des Abschnitts „Probe“</de>
									</label>
								</value-input>
								<value-input
									type="tl.core:Boolean"
									value="marked"
								>
									<label>
										<en>Mark the section "Marked" with a dot</en>
										<de>Abschnitt „Markiert“ mit einem Punkt markieren</de>
									</label>
								</value-input>
							</stack>
						</panel>

						<!-- The panel bounds the conversation's height; the head of the transcript carries the rail button. -->
						<panel fill="true">
							<chat-conversation>
								<commands>
									<generic-command
										active-expr="$railOpen"
										badge="railBadge"
										image="css:bi bi-layout-sidebar-reverse"
										inputs="railOpen"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Side rail</en>
											<de>Seitenleiste</de>
										</label>
										<execute-script function="!$railOpen">
											<with-result>
												<write-channel name="railOpen"/>
											</with-result>
										</execute-script>
									</generic-command>
								</commands>
							</chat-conversation>
						</panel>
					</stack>
				</pane>
				<pane
					size="300"
					unit="px"
				>
					<side-rail
						badge-channel="railBadge"
						drawer-below="70"
						open-channel="railOpen"
						side="right"
						width="300"
					>
						<section name="events"
							badge="eventCount"
							icon="css:bi bi-calendar-event"
							open="true"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Events</en>
								<de>Veranstaltungen</de>
							</label>
							<data-list
								count="eventCount"
								observed-types="demo.events:Event"
								row-actions="hover"
								row-channel="event"
								search="false"
							>
								<empty-text>
									<en>No events yet</en>
									<de>Noch keine Veranstaltungen</de>
								</empty-text>
								<row-commands>
									<generic-command
										image="css:bi bi-trash"
										inputs="event"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Delete event</en>
											<de>Veranstaltung löschen</de>
										</label>
										<confirm>
											<confirm-label>
												<en>Delete</en>
												<de>Löschen</de>
											</confirm-label>
											<cancel-label>
												<en>Cancel</en>
												<de>Abbrechen</de>
											</cancel-label>
											<expr><![CDATA[{
												"en": "Delete “" + $event.get(`demo.events:Named#name`)
													+ "” with its sessions, registrations, sponsorships and invoices?",
												"de": "„" + $event.get(`demo.events:Named#name`)
													+ "“ mit allen Sessions, Anmeldungen, Sponsorings und Rechnungen löschen?"
											}.internationalize()]]></expr>
										</confirm>
										<with-transaction>
											<execute-script function="$event.delete()"/>
										</with-transaction>
									</generic-command>
								</row-commands>
								<lines>
									<line attribute="name"/>
								</lines>
								<rows>all(`demo.events:Event`)</rows>
							</data-list>
						</section>
						<section name="venues"
							badge="venueCount"
							badge-role="warning"
							icon="css:bi bi-geo-alt"
							open="false"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Venues</en>
								<de>Veranstaltungsorte</de>
							</label>
							<data-list
								count="venueCount"
								observed-types="demo.events:Venue"
								search="false"
							>
								<empty-text>
									<en>No venues yet</en>
									<de>Noch keine Veranstaltungsorte</de>
								</empty-text>
								<lines>
									<line attribute="name"/>
								</lines>
								<rows>all(`demo.events:Venue`)</rows>
							</data-list>
						</section>
						<section name="trial"
							badge="trialCount"
							badge-role="error"
							icon="css:bi bi-123"
							open="false"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Trial</en>
								<de>Probe</de>
							</label>
							<text>
								<label>
									<en>Shows the number entered in the panel on the left.</en>
									<de>Zeigt die im Panel links eingegebene Zahl.</de>
								</label>
							</text>
						</section>
						<section name="marked"
							badge="marked"
							badge-role="success"
							icon="css:bi bi-bookmark"
							open="false"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Marked</en>
								<de>Markiert</de>
							</label>
							<badge-label>
								<en>New entries</en>
								<de>Neue Einträge</de>
							</badge-label>
							<text>
								<label>
									<en>Shows a dot while the checkbox in the panel on the left is ticked.</en>
									<de>Zeigt einen Punkt, solange das Kontrollkästchen im Panel links angekreuzt ist.</de>
								</label>
							</text>
						</section>
						<section name="notes"
							icon="css:bi bi-journal-text"
							open="false"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Notes</en>
								<de>Notizen</de>
							</label>
							<text>
								<label>
									<en>A section without a badge: it adds nothing to the rail button.</en>
									<de>Ein Abschnitt ohne Badge: Er trägt nichts zur Leisten-Schaltfläche bei.</de>
								</label>
							</text>
						</section>
					</side-rail>
				</pane>
			</panes>
		</split-panel>
	</chat>
</view>